<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Consolidated Freightways.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Consolidated Freightways.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it initiated coverage of Consolidated Freightways Inc as an intermediate-term accumulate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Consolidated Freightways gained 5/8 to 12-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
